   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\">Dear all,</font></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"> </font></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 10pt\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\">I’m trying to replicate a path analysis example from Schumacker\r\nand Lomax (2016). In their book, ‘a beginner’s </font><span><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\"> </font></span><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\">guide to structural equation modeling’,\r\nSchumacker and Lomax provide a </font><span><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\"> </font></span><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\">covariance\r\nmatrix of a data collected by McDonald and Clelland of union sentiment of textile\r\nworkers. </font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"> </font></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\">I’m performing the following steps, and I’m getting an\r\nerror. </font></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 10pt\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\">#store the covariance </font><span><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\"> </font></span><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\">matrix provided in the book as an object</font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\">l1=c(14.00,-5.24,-8.05,-0.48,-18.85,-5.24,-11.01,-11.08,-0.67,-17.86,-8.05,-11.08,-31.97,-1.55,-28.25,-0.48,0.67,-1.55,-1.02,-7.13,-18.85,-17.86,-28.25,-7.13,-215.66)</font></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\">#use getCov function</font></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\">getCov(l1,names=c(&quot;deference&quot;,&quot;laboract&quot;,&quot;unionsen&quot;,&quot;years&quot;,&quot;age&quot;))</font></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\">Error: p == round(p, 0) is not TRUE</font></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"> </font></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 10pt\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\">Any help </font><span><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\"> </font></span><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\">about how I\r\ncan fix the above </font><span><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\"> </font></span><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\">error will be most\r\nappreciated.</font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"> </font></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\">Thanks,</font></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\">Faiz.</font></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font></div>"
