    ],
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>The<font face=\"courier new, monospace\"> getCov() </font>function is designed to construct a symmetric matrix when you only have the lower-diagonal or upper-diagonal information.  You have all the values, so you just need to put them into a 5x5 matrix.</div><div><br></div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">matrix</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">l1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> nrow </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> ncol </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>       dimnames </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> list</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;deference&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;laboract&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;unionsen&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;years&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;age&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span></div></code></div></div>"
